{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"skill based play skill based play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","fileName":"Skill-Based Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Skill-Based Play","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-21 00:27\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Play Styles and Structures]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Styles and Structures","Feedback","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"skill based play skill based play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","fileName":"Skill-Based Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Skill-Based Play","heading":"Skill-Based Play","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Skill-based play centers satisfaction on developing and applying a capacity that improves with practice. Active skill concerns timing, coordination, dexterity, and other embodied performance; mental skill concerns memory, inference, calculation, planning, or pattern recognition.\n\nA skill becomes part of the game only when its consequences are perceptible. Clear [[Feedback]] lets players connect practice to improved performance and distinguish a demanding challenge from arbitrary failure.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Styles and Structures","Feedback","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"skill based play skill based play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Skill-Based Play.md","